WEBVTT

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:03.520
How could...

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:06.200
How could this...?

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.000
<b>"A Life's End"</b>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:45.050
I'll create an opening.

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:46.050
You...

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>Even if I have to become his shield...</i>

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:56.110
We gotta finish this quick.

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:59.300
The sun's setting soon.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:05.500
Once it gets dark, it's only a matter 
of time before Gibia start to gather here.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:11.250
You're all finished.

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:22.250
So, this is what becoming 
a Gibia feels like.

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:24.610
The moment the sun went down,

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:30.650
the heat that made my cells feel 
like they were exploding vanished.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:34.150
Now, all that remains

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:38.150
is my hatred towards you

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:41.030
and the desire to spread!

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:46.040
<i>Has he lost his memories 
and his love for his partner, too?</i>

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.080
Shut up!

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:50.080
This is for Yukinojyo!

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:51.790
Kathleen!

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:54.090
Run away while we're fighting him!

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.260
I'll play with you for a bit.

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:03.850
Appreciate that!

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:05.410
Whoa!

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:09.940
That was too close!

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:19.320
Hmm, having a tail is convenient.

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:22.200
You've sure changed an awful lot.

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:35.730
Come on!

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.260
How's this?!

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:50.500
You're tough!

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.860
You're on a different level 
than other Gibia!

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:54.710
Meteora...

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:58.030
Even as you all damaged her greatly,

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:02.870
she instinctively continued 
trying to meet me.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:05.170
That so?

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:13.100
Yet you all ganged up 
on Meteora and killed her!

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:14.130
Shut up!

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:16.750
Kenroku!

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:20.740
Hurry up and go!

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.640
Hatonami-dono! Kathleen!

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:24.890
Sensui!

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.670
I'm not running!

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:28.260
Hatonami-san!

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:35.920
Father.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:39.080
Come with me, young lady!

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:40.140
Okay.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:49.290
Just give up and become Gibia.

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:57.200
What?!

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:15.470
Take this!

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:24.070
Tch!

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:31.330
Hey! I'm not done!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:39.990
<i>He's starting to keep up 
with my damn movements.</i>

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:45.830
What?!

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:59.360
That tail's a pain in the ass!

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:09.100
Sensui!

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:13.290
Kanzaki Sensui's here to fight!

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:15.790
There you are!

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:18.770
Whoa.

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:46.840
Sensui!

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.310
Yoshinaga!

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.410
What?!

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:42.370
<i>Suigetsumaru?!</i>

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:56.160
Now, with this...

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:59.600
So, this one is Sakuma's bag.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.550
Ayame...

00:07:01.550 --> 00:07:04.610
Ayame... Wait for me...

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:14.620
How far do you think you'll get 
with just one sword?

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.170
Sensui!

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:08.230
Ah, these are the Sensui-kun attacks 
that have cut down so many Gibia thus far.

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:11.920
It feels like I'm listening 
to pleasant music.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:20.570
<i>We don't have a weapon that works on him!</i>

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:45.790
Over 90% of a Gibia's internal cells 
are in a gelatinous state.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.680
It's a mutation of proteins.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.010
They have over 80% thermal conductivity

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:54.780
and over 98% electrical conductivity.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:57.970
They have practically no electrical resistance.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:03.180
Doctor... You're the one who taught me that.

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:23.840
I see.

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:29.250
I did realize that electrical 
attacks would work on Gibia...

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.370
but that was effective.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:34.480
Rather so.

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:50.190
You monster!

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:53.280
You're calling me a monster?

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:57.560
I'm as human as you are!

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:14.800
That's the same as Ayame's?!

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:38.300
<i>Damn it! He's taken the lead!</i>

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:39.820
<i>I can't do anything!</i>

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:44.350
You're just foreign objects 
that wandered into this world!

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:48.410
Kenroku!

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.210
You're the foreign object here!

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:08.230
You all know nothing.

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:09.780
What?

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:13.290
Your time travel was nothing more

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:17.850
than the result of modulating 
the positive and negative effects

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:20.800
of me bringing the Gibia Virus here.

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:26.730
I was piloting our mothership 
using brainwaves and,

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:29.660
when the ship was destroyed,

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:36.830
the remnants orbited Earth before 
becoming comets that fell to the surface.

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:41.330
Kathleen wished upon those comets

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:43.850
and the matter in our ship
 that reacts to brainwaves

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:47.020
used its final power to grant her wish.

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:51.100
That wish summoned you three,

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:56.400
Sensui-kun, Kenroku-kun, 
and Yukinojyo-kun, to our era.

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:05.910
It was that modulation that brought 
strong men from the past to the modern day.

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:10.410
For every negative action, 
 there is a positive reaction.

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:15.190
Don't tell me you seriously thought

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:24.180
your time travel was just a coincidence.

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.860
I believe you two.

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:28.680
After all, the Gibia exist.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:33.520
<i>You're saying I summoned 
Sensui and Kenroku here?</i>

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:41.320
<i>That day back then...</i>

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:44.930
<i>There were comets I watched all day long...</i>

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.990
<i>That was a spaceship?</i>

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.870
What are you getting at, Yoshinaga?!

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:53.870
In other words,

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:58.380
that young girl's wish is the entire reason

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:03.150
you two were summoned here from the past!

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:07.580
<i>So, the reason everyone came 
to this world and suffered...</i>

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:10.110
<i>and the reason Yukinojyo-san died, was...</i>

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:11.890
<i>was because of me?</i>

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:15.560
<i>Oh, God,</i>

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:18.780
<i>please grant me power.</i>

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:23.150
<i>Grant me power!</i>

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:32.740
I never even imagined how far...

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:45.750
this series of events would go 
when the Gibia Virus covered the Earth.

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:50.550
I thought it was merely coincidence 
that you had all been chosen,

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:56.560
but as I witnessed your strength, 
I grew convinced!

00:13:57.550 --> 00:14:02.820
Our meeting was destiny!

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:09.200
My goal was to restore Meteora's 
intelligence and human body.

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:14.200
I planned to return 
to our planet together after that.

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:16.200
Though...

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.380
it's too late for that now.

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:30.340
Are you saying you were just using us 
to help achieve your goals?

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:34.970
We were just falling for your 
tricks this entire time, then.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:39.350
Precisely.

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:45.860
I was able to complete this vaccine 
that restores human intelligence to Gibia

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:51.620
thanks to the large supply 
of samples you collected for me.

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:55.370
So, in that sense, I should thank you.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:15:02.000
You're saying you just duped us 
into helping make you stronger?!

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:06.000
I think it's about time to end this.

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:11.510
We'll just have to try everything we can.

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:14.010
Damn it.

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:20.710
We've got nothing left.

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:22.270
If Yukinojyo-san were here...

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:26.520
If Yukinojyo-san were here... 
He would always...

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:31.400
I bet he'd be boasting 
and laughing like mad.

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:38.720
Hey.

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:46.320
Hatonami-dono.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:49.170
It doesn't have a name, but it's a good sword.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:50.390
Huh?

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:57.480
Kanzaki Sensui...

00:15:57.480 --> 00:15:59.680
Please avenge Ayame for me.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:06.420
Young lady.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:07.650
Huh?

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:13.070
Please live on for Ayame, too!

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:15.260
Hatonami-san?

00:16:17.090 --> 00:16:18.570
Watch closely!

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:19.950
Hatonami-san!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:24.060
How dare you...

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:26.730
How dare you hurt my daughter?!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.590
I have no business with you!

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:38.600
Hatonami-san!

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:44.260
What were you hoping to achieve?

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:48.230
Thanks.

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:51.080
This is perfect.

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:52.320
Let go.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:57.240
Letting me get this close was all I wanted.

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:04.200
Ayame...

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.760
Ayame, I'm coming for you!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.260
Hatonami-san!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.640
Old man!

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:23.380
<i>Ayame...</i>

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.650
Hatonami-dono, leave the rest to us!

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:54.670
Yoshinaga...

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.180
Sensui!

00:18:58.260 --> 00:19:01.220
Goodbye, Yoshinaga.

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:17.880
Sensui, I...

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:31.670
Hey.

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:35.050
It's over, right?

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:48.120
We have to get aboard this boat 
and get far away from here for now!

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:50.870
Hurry!

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:51.880
Yeah!

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:55.130
Sensui, you hurry up, too!

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:59.130
I'm sorry, but I can't go with you.

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.210
What?

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:01.130
Huh?

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:05.680
I was stabbed a few moments ago.

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:07.900
Back then...

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.600
I can't go with you.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.400
Kenroku, I'm leaving the rest to you.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:15.410
Huh?!

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:17.620
No way! That's just...

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:20.980
But you know there might not 
have been any virus in that stinger?

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:23.030
Maybe so.

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:26.780
But you can't afford to risk 
me turning into a Gibia

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:29.220
and attacking you on the boat.

00:20:37.850 --> 00:20:39.330
No way!

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:43.050
I haven't even had a chance 
to apologize to you properly, Sensui!

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:46.940
All of this... all of this was my...

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:50.450
If I hadn't made that wish...

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:52.150
Don't say such stupid things!

00:20:57.710 --> 00:21:01.440
I think this was for the best.

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:06.240
When the world is like this,

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:08.830
that's all the more 
reason we need hope, right?

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:11.000
Sensui...

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:13.330
Until we meet again.

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:18.330
Here.

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:21.590
Hmm?

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:24.530
No matter where we are in this world,

00:21:24.530 --> 00:21:26.760
this device will let us know 
where the other is.

00:21:32.110 --> 00:21:38.290
Is this the device Hatonami-dono 
was using when he followed us?

00:21:39.970 --> 00:21:41.280
Please...

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:45.010
Make sure you come find us!

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.620
Sensui!

00:21:54.240 --> 00:21:55.580
Sensui...

00:21:56.400 --> 00:22:02.380
Hey, he's always kept 
his promises, hasn't he?

00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:07.920
So, if he says we'll meet again, 
I'm sure we will.

00:22:09.230 --> 00:22:10.980
He's not going to die.

00:22:13.650 --> 00:22:14.640
Yeah!

00:22:22.510 --> 00:22:25.070
Heaven has brought me to this land...

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:29.560
to cut you all down!
